Common AdditionalImmunization
    documentation "Stores information about vaccinations or immunizations that students have received beyond those mandated by institutional or governmental regulations."
    string ImmunizationName
        documentation "The name of the immunization that an individual has satisfactorily received."
        is part of identity
        max length 100
    date ImmunizationDate
        documentation "The year, month and day of the related additional immunization."
        is optional collection